N5008 [temp.variadic]/4-5.  A pack expansion whose pattern is a `sizeof`
unary-expression (`sizeof(Us)...`), forwarded from an enclosing function
template, expands to the correct element count: `box<sizeof(Us)...>::n`
(n = sizeof...(Vs)) matches the number of forwarded arguments for 0, 1, 2 and 3
elements.  Previously the pack collapsed to a single element (a non-type pack was
scalar-bound to its first argument in the template map).  Non-vacuous: under the
collapse the count would be 1.
